# Backend Rules
- Routes (`<module>.routes.ts`): Binds paths to controllers. No validation or logic.
- Controllers (`<module>.controller.ts`): Zod parsing, one service call, `asyncHandler`.
- Services (`<module>.service.ts`): Pure logic, zero Express imports.
- Repositories (`<module>.repository.ts`): Drizzle queries with shared `db`.
- Always use `type` instead of `interface`.
- Update `DATABASE_SCHEMA.md` on any schema change.
